   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Typing Animation\n\nWords are typed out one after another with a blinking cursor, each deleted faster than it was typed before the next begins.\n\nCategory: typography. Length: 8 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- A line should cycle through several phrases, typing and deleting each.\n- A hero line needs a cursor that keeps blinking while words change.\n\nAvoid when:\n- Only one line needs to be typed once: use typewriter.\n- A prompt box typing a message: use typed-prompt.\n\nVariables:\n- words (string): Words, default \"Fast typing|Slow delete\"\n- font_size (number, 12-240): Font size, default 96\n- color (color): Colour, default \"#0a0a0a\"\n- font_weight (enum): Font weight, default \"600\"\n- cursor_style (enum): Cursor, default \"line\"\n- blink (enum): Cursor blink, default \"yes\"\n- type_speed (number, 20-400): Type speed, default 100\n- delete_speed (number, 0-400): Delete speed, default 50\n- pause (number, 0-5000): Pause, default 1000\n- delay (number, 0-3000): Delay, default 300\n- loop (enum): Loop, default \"no\"\n\nSource: https://github.com/magicuidesign/magicui. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
  {
   "path": "scene.html",
   "role": "source",
   "content": "<!doctype html>\n<!--\n  Typing Animation\n\n  Words are typed out one after another with a blinking cursor, each deleted faster than it was typed before the next begins.\n\n  Ported to an HTML + GSAP sub-composition by usemosio/blocks from:\n  https://github.com/magicuidesign/magicui/blob/166367b4e31a27f166fd6c2b71d7be290fe0c1bc/apps/www/registry/magicui/typing-animation.tsx\n\n  MIT License\n\n  Copyright (c) Magic UI\n\n  Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a copy\n  of this software and associated documentation files (the \"Software\"), to deal\n  in the Software without restriction, including without limitation the rights\n  to use, copy, modify, merge, publish, distribute, sublicense, and/or sell\n  copies of the Software, and to permit persons to whom the Software is\n  furnished to do so, subject to the following conditions:\n\n  The above copyright notice and this permission notice shall be included in all\n  copies or substantial portions of the Software.\n\n  THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED \"AS IS\", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR\n  IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY,\n  FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE\n  AUTHORS OR COPYRIGHT HOLDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER\n  LIABILITY, WHETHER IN AN ACTION OF CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE, ARISING FROM,\n  OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE SOFTWARE OR THE USE OR OTHER DEALINGS IN THE\n  SOFTWARE.\n-->\n<html\n  lang=\"en\"\n  data-composition-id=\"typing-animation\"\n  data-composition-duration=\"8\"\n  data-composition-variables='[\n    {\"id\": \"words\", \"type\": \"string\", \"role\": \"content\", \"label\": \"Words\", \"description\": \"The phrases in order, separated by | .\", \"default\": \"Fast typing|Slow delete\"},\n    {\"id\": \"font_size\", \"type\": \"number\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Font size\", \"description\": \"Maximum text size in pixels. Longer text shrinks to fit the frame.\", \"default\": 96, \"min\": 12, \"max\": 240, \"step\": 1, \"unit\": \"px\"},\n    {\"id\": \"color\", \"type\": \"color\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Colour\", \"description\": \"Text and cursor colour.\", \"default\": \"#0a0a0a\"},\n    {\"id\": \"font_weight\", \"type\": \"enum\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Font weight\", \"description\": \"Weight of the text.\", \"default\": \"600\", \"options\": [{\"value\": \"400\", \"label\": \"Regular\"}, {\"value\": \"500\", \"label\": \"Medium\"}, {\"value\": \"600\", \"label\": \"Semibold\"}, {\"value\": \"700\", \"label\": \"Bold\"}, {\"value\": \"800\", \"label\": \"Extra bold\"}]},\n    {\"id\": \"cursor_style\", \"type\": \"enum\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Cursor\", \"description\": \"Cursor shape.\", \"default\": \"line\", \"options\": [{\"value\": \"line\", \"label\": \"Line\"}, {\"value\": \"block\", \"label\": \"Block\"}, {\"value\": \"underscore\", \"label\": \"Underscore\"}]},\n    {\"id\": \"blink\", \"type\": \"enum\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Cursor blink\", \"description\": \"Whether the cursor blinks.\", \"default\": \"yes\", \"options\": [{\"value\": \"yes\", \"label\": \"Blink\"}, {\"value\": \"no\", \"label\": \"Steady\"}]},\n    {\"id\": \"type_speed\", \"type\": \"number\", \"role\": \"motion\", \"label\": \"Type speed\", \"description\": \"Milliseconds per typed character (the source uses 100).\", \"default\": 100, \"min\": 20, \"max\": 400, \"step\": 5, \"unit\": \"ms\"},\n    {\"id\": \"delete_speed\", \"type\": \"number\", \"role\": \"motion\", \"label\": \"Delete speed\", \"description\": \"Milliseconds per deleted character; 0 means half the type speed (as the source).\", \"default\": 50, \"min\": 0, \"max\": 400, \"step\": 5, \"unit\": \"ms\"},\n    {\"id\": \"pause\", \"type\": \"number\", \"role\": \"motion\", \"label\": \"Pause\", \"description\": \"Milliseconds a finished phrase stays before it is deleted (the source uses 1000).\", \"default\": 1000, \"min\": 0, \"max\": 5000, \"step\": 50, \"unit\": \"ms\"},\n    {\"id\": \"delay\", \"type\": \"number\", \"role\": \"motion\", \"label\": \"Delay\", \"description\": \"Milliseconds before typing starts.\", \"default\": 300, \"min\": 0, \"max\": 3000, \"step\": 50, \"unit\": \"ms\"},\n    {\"id\": \"loop\", \"type\": \"enum\", \"role\": \"motion\", \"label\": \"Loop\", \"description\": \"Whether the last phrase is also deleted and the list starts over.\", \"default\": \"no\", \"options\": [{\"value\": \"no\", \"label\": \"Stop on the last phrase\"}, {\"value\": \"yes\", \"label\": \"Loop\"}]}\n  ]'\n>\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <title>Typing Animation</title>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <template>\n      <link\n        rel=\"stylesheet\"\n        href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@400;500;600;700&amp;display=block\"\n      />\n      <style>\n        #root {\n          position: absolute;\n          inset: 0;\n          overflow: hidden;\n          container-type: size;\n          pointer-events: none;\n        }\n        .tpa-stage { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }\n        .tpa-line { font-family: var(--font-display, Geist, system-ui, sans-serif); letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.2; white-space: pre; display: inline-block; }\n      </style>\n\n      <div id=\"root\" data-composition-id=\"typing-animation\" data-duration=\"8\" data-fps=\"30\">\n        <div id=\"tpa-clip\" class=\"tpa-stage clip\" data-start=\"0\" data-duration=\"8\" data-track-index=\"0\">\n          <div id=\"tpa-line\" class=\"tpa-line\"><span id=\"tpa-text\"></span><span id=\"tpa-cursor\"></span></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.14.2/dist/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n        <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.14.2/dist/CustomEase.min.js\"></script>\n        <script>\n          (function () {\n            \"use strict\";\n            var root = document.getElementById(\"root\");\n            var vars =\n              window.__hyperframes && window.__hyperframes.getVariables\n                ? window.__hyperframes.getVariables()\n                : {};\n            function num(value, fallback, min, max) {\n              var n = Number(value);\n              return Number.isFinite(n) ? Math.min(max, Math.max(min, n)) : fallback;\n            }\n            function str(value, fallback) {\n              return typeof value === \"string\" && value.trim() ? value : fallback;\n            }\n            function col(value, fallback) {\n              return typeof value === \"string\" && value ? value : fallback;\n            }\n            function pick(value, options, fallback) {\n              return options.indexOf(String(value)) >= 0 ? String(value) : fallback;\n            }\n            // Shrink an element's font until it fits a share of the frame width.\n            function fit(el, size, share) {\n              el.style.fontSize = size + \"px\";\n              var max = Math.max(1, root.clientWidth * share);\n              if (el.scrollWidth > max) {\n                size = Math.max(12, size * (max / el.scrollWidth));\n                el.style.fontSize = size + \"px\";\n              }\n              return size;\n            }\n            // A seeded random generator, so every seek draws the same thing.\n            function mulberry32(a) {\n              return function () {\n                a |= 0; a = (a + 0x6d2b79f5) | 0;\n                var t = Math.imul(a ^ (a >>> 15), 1 | a);\n                t = (t + Math.imul(t ^ (t >>> 7), 61 | t)) ^ t;\n                return ((t ^ (t >>> 14)) >>> 0) / 4294967296;\n              };\n            }\n            function clamp01(x) { return x < 0 ? 0 : x > 1 ? 1 : x; }\n            gsap.registerPlugin(CustomEase);\n            var TAG = \"tpa\";\n            var bezN = 0;\n            function bez(x1, y1, x2, y2) {\n              return CustomEase.create(TAG + \"-\" + bezN++, \"M0,0 C\" + x1 + \",\" + y1 + \" \" + x2 + \",\" + y2 + \" 1,1\");\n            }\n            var tl = gsap.timeline({ paused: true });\n            function finish() {\n              var total = parseFloat(root.dataset.duration || \"8\");\n              if (tl.duration() < total) tl.to({}, { duration: total - tl.duration() });\n              tl.seek(0);\n              window.__timelines = window.__timelines || {};\n              window.__timelines[\"typing-animation\"] = tl;\n            }\n\n            var line = document.getElementById(\"tpa-line\");\n            var textEl = document.getElementById(\"tpa-text\");\n            var cur = document.getElementById(\"tpa-cursor\");\n            var words = str(vars.words, \"Fast typing|Slow delete\").split(\"|\").map(function (w) { return w.trim(); }).filter(Boolean);\n            if (!words.length) words = [\"Fast typing\"];\n            var typeMs = num(vars.type_speed, 100, 20, 400);\n            var delMs = num(vars.delete_speed, 50, 0, 400) || typeMs / 2;\n            var pauseMs = num(vars.pause, 1000, 0, 5000);\n            var delayMs = num(vars.delay, 300, 0, 3000);\n            var loop = String(vars.loop) === \"yes\";\n            var blink = String(vars.blink) !== \"no\";\n            var total = parseFloat(root.dataset.duration || \"8\");\n            line.style.color = col(vars.color, \"#0a0a0a\");\n            line.style.fontWeight = pick(vars.font_weight, [\"400\", \"500\", \"600\", \"700\", \"800\"], \"600\");\n            cur.textContent = { block: \"\\u258C\", underscore: \"_\", line: \"|\" }[pick(vars.cursor_style, [\"line\", \"block\", \"underscore\"], \"line\")];\n            cur.style.display = \"inline-block\";\n            var many = words.length > 1;\n            // Same state machine as the source (type, pause, delete), as a list of timed text states.\n            var events = [{ t: 0, text: \"\", cursor: true }];\n            var t = delayMs / 1000, wi = 0, done = false, guard = 0;\n            var first = true;\n            while (!done && t < total + 1 && guard++ < 5000) {\n              var chars = Array.from(words[wi]);\n              for (var i = 1; i <= chars.length; i++) {\n                if (!(first && i === 1 && delayMs > 0)) t += typeMs / 1000;\n                events.push({ t: t, text: chars.slice(0, i).join(\"\"), cursor: true });\n              }\n              first = false;\n              var last = wi === words.length - 1;\n              if (many || loop) {\n                if (last && !loop) { done = true; events.push({ t: t + 0.0001, text: words[wi], cursor: false }); break; }\n                t += pauseMs / 1000;\n                for (var k = chars.length - 1; k >= 0; k--) {\n                  t += delMs / 1000;\n                  events.push({ t: t, text: chars.slice(0, k).join(\"\"), cursor: true });\n                }\n                t += delMs / 1000;\n                wi = (wi + 1) % words.length;\n              } else {\n                done = true;\n                events.push({ t: t + 0.0001, text: words[wi], cursor: false });\n              }\n            }\n            // Fit to the widest phrase.\n            var size = num(vars.font_size, 96, 12, 240);\n            line.style.fontSize = size + \"px\";\n            var widest = 1;\n            words.forEach(function (w) { textEl.textContent = w; widest = Math.max(widest, line.scrollWidth); });\n            if (widest > root.clientWidth * 0.9) { size = Math.max(12, size * root.clientWidth * 0.9 / widest); line.style.fontSize = size + \"px\"; }\n            var clock = { t: 0 };\n            function draw(now) {\n              var e = events[0];\n              for (var q = 0; q < events.length; q++) { if (events[q].t <= now) e = events[q]; else break; }\n              textEl.textContent = e.text;\n              var on = true;\n              if (blink) on = (now % 1.2) < 0.6; // blink-cursor 1.2 s, step-end\n              cur.style.visibility = e.cursor && on ? \"visible\" : \"hidden\";\n            }\n            tl.to(clock, { t: total, duration: total, ease: \"none\", onUpdate: function () { draw(clock.t); } }, 0);\n            draw(0);\n\n            finish();\n          })();\n        </script>\n      </div>\n    </template>\n  </body>\n</html>\n"
  }
 ],
 "sha256": "3d0ac1c27506c02cab466daa9b340c7f0e78360c6457025b8310857c9bab54ce",
